WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.733 --> 00:00:05.883
Hi, friends!

2
00:00:05.933 --> 00:00:08.400
Today, we are going down!

3
00:00:08.467 --> 00:00:11.917
Down, down, down into the sea!

4
00:00:11.967 --> 00:00:14.150
We are going very deep.

5
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.717
Look, it is getting dark.

6
00:00:16.767 --> 00:00:18.583
We are down here now.

7
00:00:18.633 --> 00:00:21.400
It is as dark as night!

8
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:24.000
Who lives down here?

9
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.683
Look! A little light!

10
00:00:28.733 --> 00:00:31.083
It is an anglerfish!

11
00:00:31.133 --> 00:00:33.250
It lives deep in the sea.

12
00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:36.000
It is very dark there.

13
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.783
Look at its head.

14
00:00:38.833 --> 00:00:40.750
It has a fishing rod!

15
00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:43.117
The rod is on its head.

16
00:00:43.167 --> 00:00:44.717
Look at the end.

17
00:00:44.767 --> 00:00:46.883
There is a little light!

18
00:00:46.933 --> 00:00:49.600
The light is glowing in the dark.

19
00:00:49.667 --> 00:00:52.800
It is glowing like a little lamp.

20
00:00:54.133 --> 00:00:57.183
Look, the anglerfish is waiting.

21
00:00:57.233 --> 00:01:00.183
It is very, very still.

22
00:01:00.233 --> 00:01:02.450
Here comes a small fish.

23
00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:04.750
It swims to the light.

24
00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:06.883
Closer and closer...

25
00:01:06.933 --> 00:01:08.450
Gulp!

26
00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:11.800
The anglerfish ate it in one bite!

27
00:01:12.867 --> 00:01:14.583
Look at its mouth.

28
00:01:14.633 --> 00:01:16.517
It is so big!

29
00:01:16.567 --> 00:01:18.400
And look at its teeth!

30
00:01:18.467 --> 00:01:22.200
They are long and sharp, like needles.

31
00:01:22.467 --> 00:01:25.200
A fish cannot get out!

32
00:01:26.267 --> 00:01:28.917
The anglerfish can eat big food.

33
00:01:28.967 --> 00:01:31.383
Almost as big as itself!

34
00:01:31.433 --> 00:01:35.200
Its tummy stretches, like a balloon!

35
00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:39.083
Most anglerfish are small.

36
00:01:39.133 --> 00:01:40.983
Look at your fist.

37
00:01:41.033 --> 00:01:43.800
Many are about that big!

38
00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:46.317
This one fits in a hand!

39
00:01:46.367 --> 00:01:49.400
A few grow bigger than a football!

40
00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:52.700
Let's say the new words!

41
00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:54.800
Anglerfish!

42
00:01:57.100 --> 00:01:58.100
Light!

43
00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:01.400
Glowing!

44
00:02:03.780 --> 00:02:05.100
Fishing rod!

45
00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:08.700
Mouth!

46
00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:11.900
Teeth!

47
00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:14.800
Sharp!

48
00:02:17.050 --> 00:02:18.100
Gulp!

49
00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:21.600
Great job!

50
00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:25.000
Bye-bye, anglerfish!

51
00:02:25.550 --> 00:02:27.100
Keep your light glowing!

52
00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:29.500
See you next time!
